#: ../../book/sources.rst:160
msgid "Research and Historical References Added in This Review"
msgstr "Referencias de investigación e historia añadidas en la revisión"

#: ../../book/sources.rst:163
msgid ""
"``NTIA``: `Dual-Use Foundation Models with Widely Available Model Weights "
"(July 2024) <https://www.ntia.gov/sites/default/files/publications/ntia-ai-"
"open-model-report.pdf>`_. A government assessment of benefits, risks and "
"monitoring recommendations for then-current open models, not evidence about "
"every future model."
msgstr ""
"``NTIA``: Informe de julio de 2024 sobre modelos con pesos disponibles. "
"Evalúa beneficios, riesgos y seguimiento para los modelos de entonces, no "
"todos los futuros. `Dual-Use Foundation Models with Widely Available Model "
"Weights (July 2024) "
"<https://www.ntia.gov/sites/default/files/publications/ntia-ai-open-model-"
"report.pdf>`_"

#: ../../book/sources.rst:164
msgid ""
"``OPENRISK``: `On the Societal Impact of Open Foundation Models "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.07918>`_. A research position paper on marginal "
"risks and benefits. We distinguish its argument from a measured causal "
"effect of export controls."
msgstr ""
"``OPENRISK``: Investigación sobre el impacto social de modelos abiertos. Su "
"argumento sobre riesgos marginales no es una medición causal de los "
"controles de exportación. `On the Societal Impact of Open Foundation Models "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.07918>`_"

#: ../../book/sources.rst:165
msgid ""
"``GAME``: `A Course in Networks and Markets, Chapter 1 "
"<https://www.cs.cornell.edu/~rafael/networks-html/chapter1.html>`_. "
"Definitions of games, best responses and equilibrium. Our particular scores "
"and repeated-game calculation are the book's own example."
msgstr ""
"``GAME``: Manual de redes y mercados, capítulo 1. Define juegos, mejores "
"respuestas y equilibrio. Las puntuaciones y el cálculo repetido son ejemplos"
" propios del libro. `A Course in Networks and Markets, Chapter 1 "
"<https://www.cs.cornell.edu/~rafael/networks-html/chapter1.html>`_"

#: ../../book/sources.rst:166
msgid ""
"``JEFFERSON``: `Thomas Jefferson to Isaac McPherson, 13 August 1813 "
"<https://founders.archives.gov/documents/Jefferson/03-06-02-0322>`_. The "
"original source of the candle quotation. The analogy does not itself "
"establish an economic effect."
msgstr ""
"``JEFFERSON``: Carta a Isaac McPherson del 13 de agosto de 1813. Es la "
"fuente de la cita de la vela; la analogía no demuestra un efecto económico. "
"`Thomas Jefferson to Isaac McPherson, 13 August 1813 "
"<https://founders.archives.gov/documents/Jefferson/03-06-02-0322>`_"

